## Performance Characteristics

- **Counterexample messages:** O(1) registration, O(n) evaluation on failure only
- **Histogram formatting:** O(n log n) for sorting, O(n) for rendering
- **Table formatting:** O(n log n) per category for sorting
- **Coverage status:** O(1) per check

