## Integration Points

### Inbound
- ClassificationContext (provides context for message registration)
- ClassifyingPropertyRunner (consumes messages for result construction)
- PropertyResult (provides failure case data)

### Outbound
- Swift Testing integration (will consume custom messages in #expect output)
- FailureReport (can include custom messages in formatted output)
- Future: IDE integration (custom messages in test explorer)

